  "query": "Implement module debounce3(input clk, input rst_n, input din, output q). Use rising clock edges, asynchronous active-low reset, and Moore outputs. Initially q=0. While q=0, require three consecutive sampled ones to change q to 1 on the third edge; any zero restarts this count. While q=1, require two consecutive sampled zeros to change q to 0 on the second edge; any one restarts this count. q otherwise holds.",
